### Listar todas las variantes o filtrar por producto
GET http://sheapshopping.com/backend/listar_inventario?id_producto=1
Accept: application/json

### Registrar una variante (producto+talla)
POST http://sheapshopping.com/backend/agregar_inventario
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_producto": 1,
  "talla": "M",
  "stock": 20
}

### Actualizar talla o stock
PUT http://sheapshopping.com/backend/update_inventario
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_inventario": 2,
  "talla": "M",
  "stock": 20
}

### Eliminar variante
DELETE http://sheapshopping.com/backend/delete_inventario
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_inventario": 2
}
